r6 defaults (completeness audit 29 Sep 2026) - PIERRE DECIDES, not applied by apply-r6.sh unless --defaults.
charger=1: the charger group (qcom_smbx with the stock FCC/ICL/float limits + a6l-chg-guard software JEITA) loads at
boot and in off-mode charging. With charger=0 the PMIC charges on bootloader/hardware defaults only: no stock limits,
no software JEITA, no QC3 fast charge (H48/H49; rom/modules/charger.txt). Radio/ADB defaults stay in 0001-release-defaults.patch.
camera stays 0 until the camera provider exists.
